  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When I moved into a new house a few weeks ago, my books, as was natural, moved with me.",
      "output_sha256": "381b8c3f498b5afb30e26500e90b7786891bc57c8c12b8416766024e27edd78f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "381b8c3f498b5afb30e26500e90b7786891bc57c8c12b8416766024e27edd78f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Strong men, sweaty from exertion, packed them into boxes and lugged them to the moving van, grumbling about Caxton as they worked.",
      "output_sha256": "4e2ab174c7a951edd833b34d5972079d96f523887629939437651117c2d228c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.561142,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "52b8435278870b924f0e8b14f969a73776e10c39e98221076eff41218ee02ad9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4e2ab174c7a951edd833b34d5972079d96f523887629939437651117c2d228c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "On arrival at this end, they staggered with them into the room selected for my library, heaved off the lids of the cases, and awaited orders.",
      "output_sha256": "1b142854cd1cc3ee2fa1611526be6846c56fbf09c4a126b22dd0ec27a58aa88a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "1b142854cd1cc3ee2fa1611526be6846c56fbf09c4a126b22dd0ec27a58aa88a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The immediate need was for an emptier room.",
      "output_sha256": "4134962cb02898ea8e5d40eb642761b852225b287608fc4f2fc2283b0c1f013c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "4134962cb02898ea8e5d40eb642761b852225b287608fc4f2fc2283b0c1f013c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Together we hurried the books into the new white shelves which awaited them, the order in which they stood being of no matter so long as they were off the floor.",
      "output_sha256": "41ab2f7e2f324796f74278fe61107fa8e33802ffd340cc1201fcac232b28c1a4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "41ab2f7e2f324796f74278fe61107fa8e33802ffd340cc1201fcac232b28c1a4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Armful after armful was hastily stacked, the only pause being when (in the curious way in which these things happen) my own name suddenly caught the eye of the foreman.",
      "output_sha256": "1993a3b880e5c98a84d69cbb7977b1ec25bd83982499bdce810448ee6ac588e0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "1993a3b880e5c98a84d69cbb7977b1ec25bd83982499bdce810448ee6ac588e0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "\"Did you write this one, sir?\" he inquired.",
      "output_sha256": "a24400011aa554f3c5d08784931fbc3505e068d7ad5c6fd26eb95ed4ba0e632c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.84375,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6b8dbf4848310397fa1ea76b9b9156609b8b4772243e594038f7e41a99470da4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a24400011aa554f3c5d08784931fbc3505e068d7ad5c6fd26eb95ed4ba0e632c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I admitted it.",
      "output_sha256": "d57e40517d541621141ca121255763ef8e3b12b782f6c2e54a3ecff90e7b4636",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "d57e40517d541621141ca121255763ef8e3b12b782f6c2e54a3ecff90e7b4636",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"H'm,\" he said noncommittally.",
      "output_sha256": "f9bb89e2de7439630502dda0bef8c022081045bc88f222fca9235ca1c820044e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "f9bb89e2de7439630502dda0bef8c022081045bc88f222fca9235ca1c820044e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He glanced along the names of every armful after that, and appeared a little surprised at the number of books which I hadn't written.",
      "output_sha256": "b09b2eedff3dce6a312b466c87043e9d5b902a2f101e520c8d631b5c5e5ff6e2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "b09b2eedff3dce6a312b466c87043e9d5b902a2f101e520c8d631b5c5e5ff6e2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "An easy-going profession, evidently.",
      "output_sha256": "c1f4d57d9676fae8c206752395cd4794cf7f0a3e2a6dd7492fb98ff7e178b470",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "c1f4d57d9676fae8c206752395cd4794cf7f0a3e2a6dd7492fb98ff7e178b470",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Eventually, the books found their place on the shelves, and there they remain.",
      "output_sha256": "2efb0156249b0c52c4ddf687a9d1e40089f9a8ce97b7ec1f86d07556c1556f48",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.403077,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "153e30c2b3ce03adf380127ccb642c7780738f40e2ef02a4f9e91087345718e6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2efb0156249b0c52c4ddf687a9d1e40089f9a8ce97b7ec1f86d07556c1556f48",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I told myself that I would organize them properly when a rainy day presented itself.",
      "output_sha256": "81e7f18bcc09aec9f1c17a3dc90f637c6a0f2f0d72ee21571bcfdba4ab7914f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.505,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "88dd854d5cdcb76a4ca950312e37aac82dbe0772835c64b67bf5b05ddc5fbd7d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "81e7f18bcc09aec9f1c17a3dc90f637c6a0f2f0d72ee21571bcfdba4ab7914f6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "When that rainy day finally arrived, I instead pushed the task to some future morning.",
      "output_sha256": "e9a297c6f8835bb5c9cd88b225922befc0aa690fd57e02f1ac5f66b68bb30cb1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.284848,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4802d10e73e74c10d49c0fc604dc7dd2056c29df9136917628ba7d6d51e729a1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e9a297c6f8835bb5c9cd88b225922befc0aa690fd57e02f1ac5f66b68bb30cb1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "As they are now, I have to look along every shelf in the search for the book which I want.",
      "output_sha256": "dc762d2e58810b998e0b0f698f989972b9077805e842eae2e106281ee7f1a0a3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "dc762d2e58810b998e0b0f698f989972b9077805e842eae2e106281ee7f1a0a3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To come to Keats is no guarantee that we are on the road to Shelley.",
      "output_sha256": "969de67da1f83f99251f56a9c50d2fbdcc6a0d41fe60d6d513fa095982e02216",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "969de67da1f83f99251f56a9c50d2fbdcc6a0d41fe60d6d513fa095982e02216",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If he hasn’t mysteriously vanished, he’s likely wedged between How to Be a Golfer Though Middle-aged and something else equally perplexing.",
      "output_sha256": "975586a48456b32a9f9ee78db3747e9996eedff2f0c7abb6716974b0e11dc559",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.483117,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "92c5c800e7874acb6cc1e95a2a05aa7352271abd9e8d1d9095fd84e29d3f6a01"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "975586a48456b32a9f9ee78db3747e9996eedff2f0c7abb6716974b0e11dc559",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Having written as far as this, I had to get up and see where Shelley really was.",
      "output_sha256": "9b903e4dc01eb455dfbabd96b6c25d6c3cab8a584a1f8fa96310587270200152",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "9b903e4dc01eb455dfbabd96b6c25d6c3cab8a584a1f8fa96310587270200152",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is worse than I thought.",
      "output_sha256": "c8f85890c9ed8965cf5c220cbd206f15018a40bc7b8ea9b143775482106a9cd4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "c8f85890c9ed8965cf5c220cbd206f15018a40bc7b8ea9b143775482106a9cd4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He is currently lodged between Geometrical Optics and Studies in New Zealand Scenery.",
      "output_sha256": "44dac41c8a85ea76096794794300e48d5ea1b6e66f70e1529490a4a79ce9f137",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.865064,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "23b6e18b5ae45223159035346915ede538d315abbb9e9007040ba298456d8a21"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "44dac41c8a85ea76096794794300e48d5ea1b6e66f70e1529490a4a79ce9f137",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Ella Wheeler Wilcox, whom I find myself to be entertaining unawares, sits beside Anarchy or Order, which was apparently \"sent in the hope that you will become a member of the Duty and Discipline Movement\"—a vain hope, it would seem, for I have not yet paid my subscription.",
      "output_sha256": "ebb0908decd0725c2892a9b60626a15b7a0b3af1af4f8a1e91e7d310d393f702",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "ebb0908decd0725c2892a9b60626a15b7a0b3af1af4f8a1e91e7d310d393f702",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "What I Found Out, by an English Governess, shares a corner with The Recreations of a Country Parson; they are followed by Villette and Baedeker's Switzerland.",
      "output_sha256": "31b671d20dad428329441f742e5f19cb9e6e7904373cbea5ee8a8c731e07174a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "31b671d20dad428329441f742e5f19cb9e6e7904373cbea5ee8a8c731e07174a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Something will have to be done about it.",
      "output_sha256": "d4a90161152873b39b29e02e8bd90a4cd9d6babdbafde48fc3714a5ac3730065",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "d4a90161152873b39b29e02e8bd90a4cd9d6babdbafde48fc3714a5ac3730065",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, I find myself pondering what that action should be.",
      "output_sha256": "07061049e72eae84afa238df1de924f1364f57db3ad9f0005011d171d0cb59e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.352105,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9a305194e5d3494025dfb648db3d145b40f5f7ffe1eeca52999e66c94fd683ee"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "07061049e72eae84afa238df1de924f1364f57db3ad9f0005011d171d0cb59e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If I gave you the impression that my books were precisely arranged in their old shelves, I misled you.",
      "output_sha256": "07bb24e62ef1da11aaa931847d9578615ee302aa269ddba64085876cde338ef9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "07bb24e62ef1da11aaa931847d9578615ee302aa269ddba64085876cde338ef9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They were arranged in the order known as \"all anyhow.\"",
      "output_sha256": "b1648e00948135da0d09b4b3600a0136fdba47aa7dae4ba2a2b6212563d2474c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1648e00948135da0d09b4b3600a0136fdba47aa7dae4ba2a2b6212563d2474c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Perhaps they were slightly less \"anyhow\" than they are now, as volumes of the same work were at least grouped together, but that’s about the extent of their order.",
      "output_sha256": "47c12c07f282eba7b86dce91d2bd28422429de768d6917366b3082de7a703d98",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.512363,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2e762ea29a4d30f91de79b25b5ba2102d5f1ceff46ecfd70e5b0329cc2b584ec"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "47c12c07f282eba7b86dce91d2bd28422429de768d6917366b3082de7a703d98",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "For years, I avoided the task of tidying them up, just as I’m continuing to do now.",
      "output_sha256": "1788ed72a0db1c78ddd9fffe99328d4a62db5651525560123277e8ad1fb93f41",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.603947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7aae6498b3f77214387d972f0b3028a8cf0dd271060de47f4f8ef06c0ffbe018"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1788ed72a0db1c78ddd9fffe99328d4a62db5651525560123277e8ad1fb93f41",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is not laziness; it is simply that I don't know how to begin.",
      "output_sha256": "62b5845a22e71c27060b923fcf9803b6d7efb87c774cc53f885a41d9c7054365",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "62b5845a22e71c27060b923fcf9803b6d7efb87c774cc53f885a41d9c7054365",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Let’s consider the idea of grouping all the poetry together.",
      "output_sha256": "2af23a4f9966ae4bbc26fd9a0e38270d750d50da017ec882f469a68a6a7d0206",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.462121,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ed9385bc8f7da94e8a2324ef25fbb00e0abe9a5c876f356620ee42e2e13ff5b5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2af23a4f9966ae4bbc26fd9a0e38270d750d50da017ec882f469a68a6a7d0206",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It sounds reasonable.",
      "output_sha256": "19cfed0be2cc3bcd674d006c8488a567be3a67340bc129ac8281e47cf51b254e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "19cfed0be2cc3bcd674d006c8488a567be3a67340bc129ac8281e47cf51b254e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But then Byron is eleven inches high (my tallest poet), and Beattie (my shortest) is just over four inches.",
      "output_sha256": "e85fd645e3dbb22ca14b78447efa91d3e5a00ed7b9e353b29f3866a794fc7e04",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "e85fd645e3dbb22ca14b78447efa91d3e5a00ed7b9e353b29f3866a794fc7e04",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "How foolish they will look standing side by side.",
      "output_sha256": "66d7727d03b93d41e83bff5d42a76904ebc74eeeb26bf51055b5b6ec7f2e7d2d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "66d7727d03b93d41e83bff5d42a76904ebc74eeeb26bf51055b5b6ec7f2e7d2d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Perhaps you don't know Beattie, but I assure you that he was a poet.",
      "output_sha256": "d59068dbab0f858055e42195807b1b36113f3ae9ca82046d4ee099dd16f070bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "d59068dbab0f858055e42195807b1b36113f3ae9ca82046d4ee099dd16f070bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He wrote those majestic lines:—",
      "output_sha256": "1cbe8b2f7eee525d7f6ee5136c0fbb82faba84f18bbd667f13d7b4855e03ec29",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "1cbe8b2f7eee525d7f6ee5136c0fbb82faba84f18bbd667f13d7b4855e03ec29",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"The shepherd-swain of whom I mention made On Scotia's mountains fed his little flock; The sickle, scythe or plough he never swayed— An honest heart was almost all his stock.\"",
      "output_sha256": "e32dcbcfb33268ce636314ed3edac9dc05b5405696e247f001b61b75cc1041de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "e32dcbcfb33268ce636314ed3edac9dc05b5405696e247f001b61b75cc1041de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It’s hardly reasonable to expect a shepherd to wield a plow in the conventional manner, but Beattie appropriately highlighted that Edwin, the shepherd-swain, didn’t either.",
      "output_sha256": "2cc58cfaf6911b43ccc887f500865551879f9b910befb930c651dafce4ba668d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.488612,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "20ea0b5bdd350cdad6ab96727c2fba9c115e015a2f135410105f8fedf472d0e8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2cc58cfaf6911b43ccc887f500865551879f9b910befb930c651dafce4ba668d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Edwin was the name of the shepherd- swain.",
      "output_sha256": "adb5132fef9cd45a6ef745589e69d81ed7c3edf54457c8b1cae82ef1ef9f2df7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "adb5132fef9cd45a6ef745589e69d81ed7c3edf54457c8b1cae82ef1ef9f2df7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"And yet poor Edwin was no vulgar boy,\" we are told a little further on in a line that should live.",
      "output_sha256": "a80f3feb8a5217b205626b4d52b59ded4a84efdbb6318f2e4399b5fe7e03b8f9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "a80f3feb8a5217b205626b4d52b59ded4a84efdbb6318f2e4399b5fe7e03b8f9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Well, having satisfied you that Beattie was really a poet, I can now return to my argument that an eleven-inch Byron cannot stand next to a four-inch Beattie, and be followed by an eight-inch Cowper, without making the shelf look silly.",
      "output_sha256": "24fed05a6270236cd44eecd6553cdfade45e0b47146cd470894b2725b8f43e6f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "24fed05a6270236cd44eecd6553cdfade45e0b47146cd470894b2725b8f43e6f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, how could I possibly discard Beattie—Beattie, who wrote:",
      "output_sha256": "57ed0342c3c9b2522ffcacc11cb602c360cc2117f188b05fd3c13304cff536af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.796447,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b516a5bbbfe3708d514e2ebde84f7d1894d09d6a6a24308d77998370a5001192"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "57ed0342c3c9b2522ffcacc11cb602c360cc2117f188b05fd3c13304cff536af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"And now the downy cheek and deepened voice Gave dignity to Edwin's blooming prime.\"",
      "output_sha256": "53c9a1310b0150fe7512698ca63e47e401f24c9bbd358905db61121c6dbd45bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "53c9a1310b0150fe7512698ca63e47e401f24c9bbd358905db61121c6dbd45bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This reveals the conundrum.",
      "output_sha256": "e99a82c37da51e905c344c0a3dd2c73c25e8ec25ce5fc5e711499fb0e6b5ca87",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.3125,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e9164ed28360ebe21fc1757b60fa4fdd19ade13da4b1fa0d1fd3113b2c33c9e1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e99a82c37da51e905c344c0a3dd2c73c25e8ec25ce5fc5e711499fb0e6b5ca87",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If one arranges books by their contents, the shelf quickly becomes untidy.",
      "output_sha256": "cdae3ff7fd5229e0e67a33c23b6d177c0e7e0f11470ad69a86553713b5bfb9f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.446349,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f750207c0a14dc2f8d6e10c3e953e9919e454d531b118244c2523072754c1836"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cdae3ff7fd5229e0e67a33c23b6d177c0e7e0f11470ad69a86553713b5bfb9f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Conversely, organizing them by size or color might produce an aesthetically pleasing display, but it risks obscuring Beattie from the poetically inclined visitor.",
      "output_sha256": "b1b45104c08a0c60e016d35c90f08d2b53d4b9b77d53d26465cbc37abe995c0a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.370729,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7b6ca7cef759fca725bd4e71bc6968bf00b381c76b9dc1c38a72d3edbd3a447e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b1b45104c08a0c60e016d35c90f08d2b53d4b9b77d53d26465cbc37abe995c0a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Before, then, we decide what to do about it, we must ask ourselves that very awkward question, \"Why do we have books on our shelves at all?\"",
      "output_sha256": "df64691a7bebb591404501f0f465aa8e5a30eb491be64c1d0e6cd0a090b0c1b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "df64691a7bebb591404501f0f465aa8e5a30eb491be64c1d0e6cd0a090b0c1b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is a most embarrassing question to answer.",
      "output_sha256": "7736b36137248f9659794009cc74dcedce7df1df5171842a572e96d90a956494",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "7736b36137248f9659794009cc74dcedce7df1df5171842a572e96d90a956494",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Of course, you think that the proper answer (in your own case) is an indignant protest that you bought them in order to read them, and that yon put them on your shelves in order that you could refer to them when necessary.",
      "output_sha256": "2afa5b465e9953c34cb8c18102c728b0014e12920d707a5493953ae7d6506454",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "2afa5b465e9953c34cb8c18102c728b0014e12920d707a5493953ae7d6506454",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, upon deeper reflection, one realizes how foolish that answer is.",
      "output_sha256": "248cbfd08e2dcc9e0646098dc0d35057721b84ef4ef5d4c25b9c657371b92e93",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.343582,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "823d5fed1567caed8378f4538e4dfaa19750646c6a0ec0530247156e4598db93"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "248cbfd08e2dcc9e0646098dc0d35057721b84ef4ef5d4c25b9c657371b92e93",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If reading were your sole purpose, why would some books be bound in luxurious morocco or half-calf covers?",
      "output_sha256": "a0c2549c8665954a45e2a4c48184e8ec51dca92cb99d9a1f91896fc6f54c250b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.4663,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5791dbf9b26093199f64f227cc25133a0e3d609263a3413a471a6c34171b0cdf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a0c2549c8665954a45e2a4c48184e8ec51dca92cb99d9a1f91896fc6f54c250b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Why opt for a first edition when a hundredth edition could be acquired for much less?",
      "output_sha256": "169be3e0b9bc1dd593c7df703c6d39c734da6e342df93e91e38d25f551c07a42",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.637252,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a6525fddb1b75e6677bcefe8bddb84f7d0e1e76bf77b969ffb4ad0b78d2d6a3f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "169be3e0b9bc1dd593c7df703c6d39c734da6e342df93e91e38d25f551c07a42",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why have you got half a dozen copies of The Rubaiyat?",
      "output_sha256": "92b03d6246651a44ae3a5723b7db9536030b0caddcf7b9bc1ebee22d815cf54f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "92b03d6246651a44ae3a5723b7db9536030b0caddcf7b9bc1ebee22d815cf54f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "What is the particular value of this other book that you treasure it so carefully?",
      "output_sha256": "902d6bac56af68fa0dcdc7713263dc6e521127983259fa7f0c2f34f91be01512",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "902d6bac56af68fa0dcdc7713263dc6e521127983259fa7f0c2f34f91be01512",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why, the fact that its pages are uncut.",
      "output_sha256": "949bc84e5e6fbba27e94e0ace01b262acbf15f7351c6923fba96bade92724574",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "949bc84e5e6fbba27e94e0ace01b262acbf15f7351c6923fba96bade92724574",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If you were to slice the pages open and read it, would that not diminish its value?",
      "output_sha256": "e263c90527da33708d509f207f1b3a8d1fe8c725e04671a0c7af946f77c12210",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.572786,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8ebf6c42c20d3ccb56713cfc2ab3eda455c0b6957dc057bae078cf748947b0aa"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e263c90527da33708d509f207f1b3a8d1fe8c725e04671a0c7af946f77c12210",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Thus, it becomes clear that your library serves a purpose beyond mere reference.",
      "output_sha256": "8b3cff7508ea253f3c1e4b41c534dd8e013e80796c1ebe924fad9f695ea9613e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.315734,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8da6fc6849cb9cde066900b1d66d0b1e223cf0a704957071da1ed2c35a2e8710"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8b3cff7508ea253f3c1e4b41c534dd8e013e80796c1ebe924fad9f695ea9613e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "You know as well as I do that it furnishes your room; that it furnishes it more effectively than does paint or mahogany or china.",
      "output_sha256": "e7f366efa6c878bc60d53a855052f6a4b02fda9c1269015a91596d69470d5a8f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "e7f366efa6c878bc60d53a855052f6a4b02fda9c1269015a91596d69470d5a8f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "While it is certainly pleasant to have the books accessible for when you need them, such as when you’re writing an article on sea-bathing and need to recall Coleridge’s well-known words, the library is not only functional but also decorative.",
      "output_sha256": "15649de4ab9050af3744e816162f6cc9c840b543f3690ac31e28462fde884b40",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.343454,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        58,
        59,
        60
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f33911e2326381b164bf844043645b8535055a8c73f002b466cbf8912d34a1e1",
        "900f1838e32670451f54d0fdb3a52091d546040bac8d89bd0a27b3a8debe4a1f",
        "a96338137167ad07f2f11dedc0fd1a38800c46df141cf7a42aea5294b5d679ea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "15649de4ab9050af3744e816162f6cc9c840b543f3690ac31e28462fde884b40",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But do not let us be ashamed that we find it ornamental.",
      "output_sha256": "566ce189069ffe888fee22cd17b6c0a9703f15f3a45243f0af1f8af4265e950a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "566ce189069ffe888fee22cd17b6c0a9703f15f3a45243f0af1f8af4265e950a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Indeed, the more I survey it, the more I feel that my library is sufficiently ornamental as it stands.",
      "output_sha256": "50da0b9d41fbe6a991caed2b85756f3dd0ca73a7dbf81079c4f1bae2439d815d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "50da0b9d41fbe6a991caed2b85756f3dd0ca73a7dbf81079c4f1bae2439d815d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Any reassembling of the books might spoil the colour-scheme.",
      "output_sha256": "83cf53e1639d6f4e344efa06ca371275680eb1d1ba1de0209ba900b9e766dd48",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "83cf53e1639d6f4e344efa06ca371275680eb1d1ba1de0209ba900b9e766dd48",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "For example, Baedeker's Switzerland and Villette are both red, a hue that is beautifully mirrored by a volume of Browning and Jevons' Elementary Logic after a brief interlude of blue.",
      "output_sha256": "3c8d30db4c5895caa0b6ef6e379a045716c76894dc41b056e599242f00f919a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": 0.683315,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6d63c6f5d09cc118cc483be3d42d32aaa5c106fc798c1a8cb9a5d91311052c5a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3c8d30db4c5895caa0b6ef6e379a045716c76894dc41b056e599242f00f919a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We had a woman here only yesterday who said, \"How pretty your books look,\" and I am inclined to think that that is good enough.",
      "output_sha256": "e28731e2d340b0138518be2fafaf8f1b889eec5882833733b308876173ebbabf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "e28731e2d340b0138518be2fafaf8f1b889eec5882833733b308876173ebbabf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There is a careless rapture about them which I should lose if I started to arrange them methodically.",
      "output_sha256": "559ba843c309d85ae0e8003ff1c6d972d5b90c5efc49a8605136a791b5401cd8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
